*.pyc

# Data nyata yang dipakai notebook WAJIB ikut clone GitHub (jalan out-of-the-box).
# Tidak di-ignore: manuscripts/*/data/raw/ dan manuscripts/*/data/era5/ (data nyata).
# Build artifact tetap di-ignore.
manuscripts/*/data/sample/.gitkeep
!manuscripts/*/data/sample/*.csv
!manuscripts/*/data/sample/*.md
